  "issue": {
    "body": "When installing with `uv` with `UV_LINK_MODE=symlink` (cf. <https://docs.astral.sh/uv/configuration/environment/#uv_link_mode>), `StaticFiles` instances that point to a package won't work unless one explicitly sets `follow_symlink=True` when instantiating the class.\r\n\r\nI assume most people aren't aware of the issue, unless they use `UV_LINK_MODE=symlink` (which is a pretty cool way so save space on your disk).",
    "closed_at": "2024-12-10T19:20:10Z",
